  "title": "2026-07-25-eval-160035 · sandboxed-tool-fleet",
  "description": "# Sandboxed tool-execution fleet\n\nA left-to-right architecture and lifecycle diagram showing how agent requests are quota-gated, placed into warm or cold disposable environments, governed during a lease, and ultimately destroyed. Supporting sections show warm-pool supply and host quarantine, runtime controls and ephemeral output handling, and operational signals. Solid arrows carry the primary request/lifecycle flow; dashed arrows represent supervisory or policy influence.",
