      "text": "### Non-negotiable governance\n- Fixed-term lease; renewal heartbeats preserve validity\n- No renewal or absolute max age → reclaim and **destroy**\n- Image release → mark draining; destroy after active lease ends\n- Reclaimed instances never return to pool; local filesystem/process state is ephemeral\n- Quotas cover concurrent environments and aggregate runtime; excess waits fairly",
